Healthy execution worker:
`BEACON -> allocator -> CAPABILITY FIT -> EXECUTION CLAIM -> STARTED -> WORK -> RETURN -> REALLOCATE`

Healthy resident compounding worker:
`BEACON -> CLAIM -> UNIT1 RETURN -> ... -> UNIT3 CHECKPOINT -> REALLOCATE/ASSIST -> ... -> UNIT6 TARGET -> continue if useful -> <=UNIT8 -> CLOSE`

