`BEACON -> allocator -> CAPABILITY FIT -> BARRIER ENTRANT -> RELEASE -> DETERMINISTIC PIN RACE -> WINNER STARTED / LOSER REALLOCATE`; timeout path is `BARRIER ENTRANT -> TIMEOUT -> NO PIN -> REALLOCATE`.

Healthy role worker:
`BEACON -> allocator -> ROLE PIN -> GUIDE ACTION -> RECEIPT/SUCCESSORS -> REALLOCATE`

