No multi-minute `Buscando trabajo`. No worker swarm repairing workers that never owned anything. No silent disconnection between Metabolism and the fast allocator. No barrier receipt masquerading as execution authority.

Long-term rule: a discovered coordination optimization must become easier to preserve than to accidentally undo. Observability must remain cheaper than the work it observes and can never become an authority prerequisite.
